(5230111, 761625, 46097, '<td valign="top">I''ve done these, and they''re difficult. But yours is really good....sharp focus, and good depth of field. Nice colours, and colour contrast. And the tangential light adds to the textural appeal of his wings. I get the impression that some of the ''blur'' was added in post processing, rather than just due to depth of field. But its really good.</td>', 'I''ve done these, and they''re difficult. But yours is really good....sharp focus, and good depth of field. Nice colours, and colour contrast. And the tangential light adds to the textural appeal of his wings. I get the impression that some of the ''blur'' was added in post processing, rather than just due to depth of field. But its really good.', '2009-02-01 00:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
