(5230498, 761086, 60173, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I really like the composition and colors, but it looks like you missed your focal sweet spot by just a hair.<br/> <br/>One trick I learned to alleviate a slightly missed focus is to burn on the shadows level and dodge on the highlights (both at about 10%). I tested this method on your shot, and it looked a little better to me.</td>', 'Nice image. I really like the composition and colors, but it looks like you missed your focal sweet spot by just a hair. One trick I learned to alleviate a slightly missed focus is to burn on the shadows level and dodge on the highlights (both at about 10%). I tested this method on your shot, and it looked a little better to me.', '2009-02-01 02:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230505, 761667, 60173, '<td valign="top">Love the glow. I would have burned the pupils and maybe the veins. The glow made the eyes a little flat without that tonal depth being brought back.</td>', 'Love the glow. I would have burned the pupils and maybe the veins. The glow made the eyes a little flat without that tonal depth being brought back.', '2009-02-01 02:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
