(5230882, 757153, 100393, '<td valign="top">I love this place and you capture part of it really well here. However, one of the primary lines the eye is drawn too should be horizontal or vertical = each is a bit off; perhaps its just me but I find that a little frustrating.</td>', 'I love this place and you capture part of it really well here. However, one of the primary lines the eye is drawn too should be horizontal or vertical = each is a bit off; perhaps its just me but I find that a little frustrating.', '2009-02-01 07:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230886, 761340, 76598, '<td valign="top">Perhaps as a "media" image this would be very engaging, but as a stand alone in a free study I don''t think it will appeal to most of us.</td>', 'Perhaps as a "media" image this would be very engaging, but as a stand alone in a free study I don''t think it will appeal to most of us.', '2009-02-01 07:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
