(5230890, 755803, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like the way the land leads you into the image and the curve of the waves.  I also like that it looks normal and the saturation hasn''t been pushed to make it garish.</td>', 'Very nice, I like the way the land leads you into the image and the curve of the waves.  I also like that it looks normal and the saturation hasn''t been pushed to make it garish.', '2009-02-01 07:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230893, 759268, 100393, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image, but I wish it was straight - I wonder why you didn''t spend just 2 more seconds in PP putting that right.</td>', 'This is a nice image, but I wish it was straight - I wonder why you didn''t spend just 2 more seconds in PP putting that right.', '2009-02-01 07:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230894, 761589, 100393, '<td valign="top">A nice looking image - I presume those are real flakes which look amazing, but the image on the screen is too small to have an impact which lives up to the subject. Also, I wonder if absolute focus is there or not.</td>', 'A nice looking image - I presume those are real flakes which look amazing, but the image on the screen is too small to have an impact which lives up to the subject. Also, I wonder if absolute focus is there or not.', '2009-02-01 07:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230895, 760856, 100393, '<td valign="top">Good image but it frustrates the viewer with how close it is to being REALLY good - a slight bit of straightening and a tad more contrast and I''m sure this would stand out a bit more.</td>', 'Good image but it frustrates the viewer with how close it is to being REALLY good - a slight bit of straightening and a tad more contrast and I''m sure this would stand out a bit more.', '2009-02-01 07:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230896, 759611, 100393, '<td valign="top">Very well executed portrait. The tenseness of her left hand seems a bit at odds with the relaxed pose suggested by her draped right arm though.</td>', 'Very well executed portrait. The tenseness of her left hand seems a bit at odds with the relaxed pose suggested by her draped right arm though.', '2009-02-01 07:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230897, 761609, 100393, '<td valign="top">Great composition but visually,not quite there - the clipping of the bottom of the jug, the angle of the shot, frustrating the viewer with near horizontal lines, the reflection in the jug and the lighting balance between elements all detract from a really excellent idea.</td>', 'Great composition but visually,not quite there - the clipping of the bottom of the jug, the angle of the shot, frustrating the viewer with near horizontal lines, the reflection in the jug and the lighting balance between elements all detract from a really excellent idea.', '2009-02-01 07:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230899, 760964, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like the way you can see into the water and the rock sticking through the water in the foreground, I also like the rocks enclosing the image.  The one thing I would have liked to have seen is some color in the distance...but hey if it wasn''t there, it wasn''t there.</td>', 'Very nice, I like the way you can see into the water and the rock sticking through the water in the foreground, I also like the rocks enclosing the image.  The one thing I would have liked to have seen is some color in the distance...but hey if it wasn''t there, it wasn''t there.', '2009-02-01 08:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230901, 761396, 76598, '<td valign="top">Excellent, I wish we had the northern lights further south....always a winner.  Nice placement of the building in the image and the counter balance of the flare at 90 degrees.</td>', 'Excellent, I wish we had the northern lights further south....always a winner.  Nice placement of the building in the image and the counter balance of the flare at 90 degrees.', '2009-02-01 08:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230906, 761504, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very cute, from my experience others don''t appreciate this type image as much as the relative or photographer.  Well exposed, great use of DOF.</td>', 'Very cute, from my experience others don''t appreciate this type image as much as the relative or photographer.  Well exposed, great use of DOF.', '2009-02-01 08:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230909, 756828, 76598, '<td valign="top">It seems a bit out of focus and very grainy around the center boat, the composition doesn''t pull you in.</td>', 'It seems a bit out of focus and very grainy around the center boat, the composition doesn''t pull you in.', '2009-02-01 08:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
