(5230979, 758976, 65234, '<td valign="top">It looks like there was some interesting light on the tree.  I like the bright snow on the branches in contrast to the shadowy area beneath it, although I think I would like a different crop or perspective to make that contrast a bigger part of the image.  I also find the wooden thingie on the right rather abruptly breaking up the intricate pattern of the branches, while the gently rolling hill makes a nicer background.</td>', 'It looks like there was some interesting light on the tree.  I like the bright snow on the branches in contrast to the shadowy area beneath it, although I think I would like a different crop or perspective to make that contrast a bigger part of the image.  I also find the wooden thingie on the right rather abruptly breaking up the intricate pattern of the branches, while the gently rolling hill makes a nicer background.', '2009-02-01 08:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230982, 759598, 99412, '<td valign="top">7<br/>:)</td>', '7:)', '2009-02-01 08:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
