(5231001, 761633, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the lines of the bridge leading into the city.  Exposure is a little off in that the lights are somewhat blobby, but that looks like a tough exposure; the scene might be a good candidate for taking the image twice, with one image exposed for the lights and one for the darker bits of the scene, and then combining them.</td>', 'Like the lines of the bridge leading into the city.  Exposure is a little off in that the lights are somewhat blobby, but that looks like a tough exposure; the scene might be a good candidate for taking the image twice, with one image exposed for the lights and one for the darker bits of the scene, and then combining them.', '2009-02-01 08:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231007, 753400, 79057, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant shot.</td>', 'Very vibrant shot.', '2009-02-01 08:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
