(5231481, 759087, 15711, '<td valign="top">HAHA.  I think this would be so much better in black and white. Seems a touch over exposed but the idea is great.</td>', 'HAHA.  I think this would be so much better in black and white. Seems a touch over exposed but the idea is great.', '2009-02-01 10:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
