(5231576, 755178, 100301, '<td valign="top">theres a lot goin on here that causes your eye to dart around, but it contains wonderful color, texture, and light.  When you have those, it almost doesn''t matter what the picture contains.</td>', 'theres a lot goin on here that causes your eye to dart around, but it contains wonderful color, texture, and light.  When you have those, it almost doesn''t matter what the picture contains.', '2009-02-01 10:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
