(5231757, 761495, 96915, '<td valign="top">to me, the small strip of sky and trees over the hill (at the top of the frame) looks out of place.  I think that it might look better had it been cropped out.<br/> <br/>Great energy you''ve captured.</td>', 'to me, the small strip of sky and trees over the hill (at the top of the frame) looks out of place.  I think that it might look better had it been cropped out. Great energy you''ve captured.', '2009-02-01 12:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231769, 758598, 99394, '<td valign="top">Great shot... not sure if the sky being purple was intentional or not.. to me it takes away from what could have been an awesome picture. Also, I would have loved to have seen it sharp throughout. The background is a little blurred.. Not sure how possible that would be with the horses running though unless you anticipated the shot.</td>', 'Great shot... not sure if the sky being purple was intentional or not.. to me it takes away from what could have been an awesome picture. Also, I would have loved to have seen it sharp throughout. The background is a little blurred.. Not sure how possible that would be with the horses running though unless you anticipated the shot.', '2009-02-01 12:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231773, 754159, 103069, '<td valign="top">Nice....great capture of the waves and lighthouse.</td>', 'Nice....great capture of the waves and lighthouse.', '2009-02-01 12:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231776, 760845, 99394, '<td valign="top">It''s probably just me being new and all but having a hard time finding the subject? was it the snow mound? the log? the mountain?</td>', 'It''s probably just me being new and all but having a hard time finding the subject? was it the snow mound? the log? the mountain?', '2009-02-01 12:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
