(5231781, 761555, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like this image for what I see as well as what I don''t see.  I don''t care for the title, as it kind of requires me to go in a specific direction with my interpretation - something a little less controlling would allow my mind to fill in the blanks.  Anyway, your tones and lighting are wonderful. 10</td>', 'I like this image for what I see as well as what I don''t see.  I don''t care for the title, as it kind of requires me to go in a specific direction with my interpretation - something a little less controlling would allow my mind to fill in the blanks.  Anyway, your tones and lighting are wonderful. 10', '2009-02-01 12:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231783, 759030, 103069, '<td valign="top">Living in an area where Deer Hunting is a big ordeal... This is a great capture of a buck deer.  Excellent..... A+  10</td>', 'Living in an area where Deer Hunting is a big ordeal... This is a great capture of a buck deer.  Excellent..... A+  10', '2009-02-01 12:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
