(5231785, 757394, 99394, '<td valign="top">... is that a piercing? or just a ballbearing stuck in the hole? i know that comment really had nothing to do with the picture itself and i apologize :) Nice clarity on the ball.. great shot.</td>', '... is that a piercing? or just a ballbearing stuck in the hole? i know that comment really had nothing to do with the picture itself and i apologize :) Nice clarity on the ball.. great shot.', '2009-02-01 12:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
