(5232003, 760598, 97166, '<td valign="top">As he stood back, his completed vision standing there before him, he suddenly gasped in shock and snapped his plans up in front of him and stared, ready to knock the head off the incompetent builder that had botched his dream.<br/> <br/>But no, there it was, plain as day, right in front of him.<br/> <br/>He really had forgotten to include balconies for the double swing doors.<br/> <br/>They had built it just as he had laid it out in the blueprints.<br/> <br/>With a sob, he sat down on the curb and lamented.  There went the "Architect of the Year" award once again.</td>', 'As he stood back, his completed vision standing there before him, he suddenly gasped in shock and snapped his plans up in front of him and stared, ready to knock the head off the incompetent builder that had botched his dream. But no, there it was, plain as day, right in front of him. He really had forgotten to include balconies for the double swing doors. They had built it just as he had laid it out in the blueprints. With a sob, he sat down on the curb and lamented.  There went the "Architect of the Year" award once again.', '2009-02-01 13:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
