(5233998, 760867, 96751, '<td valign="top">Not voting, just commenting on my faves.  This is stunning.  Top 10 for sure.  Excellent lines, tones, detail, sharpness  Love it.</td>', 'Not voting, just commenting on my faves.  This is stunning.  Top 10 for sure.  Excellent lines, tones, detail, sharpness  Love it.', '2009-02-01 23:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234010, 759220, 96751, '<td valign="top">Holy smokes!  Not voting, but commenting on just a few. Incredible detail, sharpness, great in b/w, what a bug!!!!! If this doesn''t place in the top 3 I''d be very disappointed.</td>', 'Holy smokes!  Not voting, but commenting on just a few. Incredible detail, sharpness, great in b/w, what a bug!!!!! If this doesn''t place in the top 3 I''d be very disappointed.', '2009-02-01 23:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234027, 754603, 45475, '<td valign="top">Yeah! Great dramatic composition. Love the punch of colour from the flag. Not sure why it''d be scoring less than 6, other than perhaps it''s not HDR''d to death enough for the masses? Sad.</td>', 'Yeah! Great dramatic composition. Love the punch of colour from the flag. Not sure why it''d be scoring less than 6, other than perhaps it''s not HDR''d to death enough for the masses? Sad.', '2009-02-01 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234054, 758997, 102394, '<td valign="top">The detail is just amazing!  Very cool shot.</td>', 'The detail is just amazing!  Very cool shot.', '2009-02-02 00:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234056, 760368, 102394, '<td valign="top">Brings new meaning to being on ''pins and needles''.  I love the contrasts - fuzzy bee &amp; sharp spines of the cactus.  Really nice pic.</td>', 'Brings new meaning to being on ''pins and needles''.  I love the contrasts - fuzzy bee & sharp spines of the cactus.  Really nice pic.', '2009-02-02 00:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234068, 761584, 102394, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot a lot, the effect of the water looks great.  The dragonfly seems a bit washed out though.  Still a beautiful shot. 8</td>', 'I really like this shot a lot, the effect of the water looks great.  The dragonfly seems a bit washed out though.  Still a beautiful shot. 8', '2009-02-02 00:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234076, 759904, 102394, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but I think the lighting on the columns is a little too harsh.  I can''t tell if they are lit from behind or not, but maybe a little more shadow would make it not such a sharp contrast from the foliage.</td>', 'I like the composition, but I think the lighting on the columns is a little too harsh.  I can''t tell if they are lit from behind or not, but maybe a little more shadow would make it not such a sharp contrast from the foliage.', '2009-02-02 00:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234097, 760813, 44877, '<td valign="top">So sweet!! I love hedgehogs.</td>', 'So sweet!! I love hedgehogs.', '2009-02-02 00:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234136, 760700, 54645, '<td valign="top">Peaceful...but I''m sure she is strongly considering what may come out of that lens! I really like the complimentary colors of her coat and the background.</td>', 'Peaceful...but I''m sure she is strongly considering what may come out of that lens! I really like the complimentary colors of her coat and the background.', '2009-02-02 00:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234139, 760159, 54645, '<td valign="top">Well done. On of my favorites.  I particularly enjoy the questions running through my head when exploring this image.</td>', 'Well done. On of my favorites.  I particularly enjoy the questions running through my head when exploring this image.', '2009-02-02 00:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
