(5234541, 760125, 97313, '<td valign="top">The idea is interesting but it''s all so grey. The post-treatment gives the feeling it''s dirty.</td>', 'The idea is interesting but it''s all so grey. The post-treatment gives the feeling it''s dirty.', '2009-02-02 08:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234543, 759872, 97313, '<td valign="top">I think it''s too wide. The backgroud is ugly and gives the feeling the picture is not straight. I think the focus is on the background also, I would try the face if not the eye. It''s also very centered. A real B&amp;W would have been better than sepia.</td>', 'I think it''s too wide. The backgroud is ugly and gives the feeling the picture is not straight. I think the focus is on the background also, I would try the face if not the eye. It''s also very centered. A real B&W would have been better than sepia.', '2009-02-02 08:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
