(5234641, 761275, 79955, '<td valign="top">Nice shot wonderful details, but the blue hue is too strong. All you had to do with this shot is reduce the B;ue &amp; cyan hue to -70. and you need to be careful on the burning. On my screen it is very very clear where you over-burnt. There are clear over-burnt patches.</td>', 'Nice shot wonderful details, but the blue hue is too strong. All you had to do with this shot is reduce the B;ue & cyan hue to -70. and you need to be careful on the burning. On my screen it is very very clear where you over-burnt. There are clear over-burnt patches.', '2009-02-02 09:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
