(5234766, 761485, 94876, '<td valign="top">Great setup.  I might have toned down the highlights on the legs, though, or cropped up.  The position of the couch in the frame is also distracting to me in relation to her positioning.  I would almost prefer her being left or right of center and the couch dead center.  Also, I''m thinking that the hair in the face was a stylistic choice, and that''s fine, but not being able to see any part of her left eye feel weird to me.  Maybe sweeping her hair the other way so you''re lighting that side of her face with your key.  I don''t know, I''ve gone on too much.  I do like the image, though ;)7</td>', 'Great setup.  I might have toned down the highlights on the legs, though, or cropped up.  The position of the couch in the frame is also distracting to me in relation to her positioning.  I would almost prefer her being left or right of center and the couch dead center.  Also, I''m thinking that the hair in the face was a stylistic choice, and that''s fine, but not being able to see any part of her left eye feel weird to me.  Maybe sweeping her hair the other way so you''re lighting that side of her face with your key.  I don''t know, I''ve gone on too much.  I do like the image, though ;)7', '2009-02-02 10:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234767, 760534, 94876, '<td valign="top">This is a tasty capture! 8</td>', 'This is a tasty capture! 8', '2009-02-02 10:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
