(5235405, 760475, 100393, '<td valign="top">Interesting soft feel, a nice contrast to some of the over-sharpened images here. I think I would have liked to have seen a touch more contrast between the petals and the centres of the sunflowers - but perhaps that would throw the whole image off.<br/> <br/>Nice work.</td>', 'Interesting soft feel, a nice contrast to some of the over-sharpened images here. I think I would have liked to have seen a touch more contrast between the petals and the centres of the sunflowers - but perhaps that would throw the whole image off. Nice work.', '2009-02-02 15:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235406, 760997, 100393, '<td valign="top">Fantastic perspective. Fabulous subject - especially for those of us who have far less extreme weather.</td>', 'Fantastic perspective. Fabulous subject - especially for those of us who have far less extreme weather.', '2009-02-02 15:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235418, 754277, 94265, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful! Lovely and clear on the eyes.</td>', 'Just beautiful! Lovely and clear on the eyes.', '2009-02-02 15:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235429, 761341, 94265, '<td valign="top">This looks fantastic. I''m not really liking that the edge of the border on top is clearly visible while the border on bottom fades up seamlessly into the shot, though the unusual shot and dramatic feel make up for it. Very cool work.</td>', 'This looks fantastic. I''m not really liking that the edge of the border on top is clearly visible while the border on bottom fades up seamlessly into the shot, though the unusual shot and dramatic feel make up for it. Very cool work.', '2009-02-02 15:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235444, 760886, 94265, '<td valign="top">Perfect title, ''pride'' is exactly what I thought of when I saw his expression. Bit of a shame that the light isn''t quite catching in his left eye but a great shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Perfect title, ''pride'' is exactly what I thought of when I saw his expression. Bit of a shame that the light isn''t quite catching in his left eye but a great shot nonetheless.', '2009-02-02 15:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235484, 756777, 94265, '<td valign="top">So precious! The little monkey hat just makes the shot so much better. What an adorable smile.</td>', 'So precious! The little monkey hat just makes the shot so much better. What an adorable smile.', '2009-02-02 16:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235490, 756356, 94265, '<td valign="top">Not keen on the curved-corner border but this is a lovely pet portrait. Nice colours, his green eyes really stand out. The languid posture really captures the nature of cats. Nice work.</td>', 'Not keen on the curved-corner border but this is a lovely pet portrait. Nice colours, his green eyes really stand out. The languid posture really captures the nature of cats. Nice work.', '2009-02-02 16:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235503, 760821, 94265, '<td valign="top">So much to look at in this shot, it looked simple on thumbnail but up close, there''s lots to appreciate; the fine calligraphy, the different reflections in the glass, the lace-like texture of whatever that is on top of the sphere.... and all so very clear. Definitely a treat for the eyes.</td>', 'So much to look at in this shot, it looked simple on thumbnail but up close, there''s lots to appreciate; the fine calligraphy, the different reflections in the glass, the lace-like texture of whatever that is on top of the sphere.... and all so very clear. Definitely a treat for the eyes.', '2009-02-02 16:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235506, 757947, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is really nice, very clear and well-lit. I''d personally have lost the sunglasses on her head for the shot, as the red clashes with her lipstick and top. Otherwise, it''s a great portrait.</td>', 'This is really nice, very clear and well-lit. I''d personally have lost the sunglasses on her head for the shot, as the red clashes with her lipstick and top. Otherwise, it''s a great portrait.', '2009-02-02 16:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235507, 758440, 94265, '<td valign="top">Love the smooth, sleek look, I''m eager to know what editing process you used.</td>', 'Love the smooth, sleek look, I''m eager to know what editing process you used.', '2009-02-02 16:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235508, 760843, 94265, '<td valign="top">I wish those hairs weren''t hanging across her face and that she was a little more in the light; otherwise, a beautiful portrait.</td>', 'I wish those hairs weren''t hanging across her face and that she was a little more in the light; otherwise, a beautiful portrait.', '2009-02-02 16:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235510, 761278, 94265, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot happening here, it''s hard to find a focal point; looks like a lovely area to photograph though, maybe shooting from further back next time would help a shot like this. If there''s a spot to shoot from where more light gets in as well, that''d be good.</td>', 'There''s a lot happening here, it''s hard to find a focal point; looks like a lovely area to photograph though, maybe shooting from further back next time would help a shot like this. If there''s a spot to shoot from where more light gets in as well, that''d be good.', '2009-02-02 16:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235512, 761417, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love the ''whooshing'' effect going on here and the grain really adds to the atmosphere of the shot. Love that single dark figure too. There really is some sense of time here. Good work.</td>', 'I love the ''whooshing'' effect going on here and the grain really adds to the atmosphere of the shot. Love that single dark figure too. There really is some sense of time here. Good work.', '2009-02-02 16:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235513, 760139, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''d have prefered either having her head up, or her eyes being visibly open. She seems more sad than contemplative to me. The dress and flowers are too lovely for the melancholy expression in the shot, I feel. The lighting is excellent and the background is perfect for the colour scheme. The blue is maybe a little too jumped-up.</td>', 'I''d have prefered either having her head up, or her eyes being visibly open. She seems more sad than contemplative to me. The dress and flowers are too lovely for the melancholy expression in the shot, I feel. The lighting is excellent and the background is perfect for the colour scheme. The blue is maybe a little too jumped-up.', '2009-02-02 16:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235520, 754918, 94265, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures on the rocks and lovely smooth ripples on the water. I like the lighthouse(?) in the background too. The mixture of grey and cool blue with the warm yellow sky light is a nice contrast. I think I''d have cloned out the specks in the sky that I assume are birds.</td>', 'Interesting textures on the rocks and lovely smooth ripples on the water. I like the lighthouse(?) in the background too. The mixture of grey and cool blue with the warm yellow sky light is a nice contrast. I think I''d have cloned out the specks in the sky that I assume are birds.', '2009-02-02 16:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235522, 753355, 94265, '<td valign="top">Looks the teeniest bit OOF to me but it''s not really noticeable. Brilliant colours and a great shot of this little fella. Good DOF.</td>', 'Looks the teeniest bit OOF to me but it''s not really noticeable. Brilliant colours and a great shot of this little fella. Good DOF.', '2009-02-02 16:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235524, 760696, 94265, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the visible junk in the lower left corner there but I do like the slightly upwards angle on the cat. Little bit more light might''ve been good too.</td>', 'I don''t care for the visible junk in the lower left corner there but I do like the slightly upwards angle on the cat. Little bit more light might''ve been good too.', '2009-02-02 16:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
