(5237070, 760985, 97166, '<td valign="top">For many lonely nights she stood there, wrapped in gossamer flow, billowing in the breeze from the window beyond.  In her dreams it was always the same, she would stand there in the light of the dawn, and he would gaze at her from across the expanse of the sink, and a smile would form on his face, and she would smile back, but only slightly.  They would flirt like this for awhile, and eventually he would come to her and take her hand, and they would begin a waltz across the formica, away from the stainless steal and into a happiness untold.<br/> <br/>But that was only in her dreams.  As she stood there once more, and gazed across the sink, she saw that once more he would not even acknowledge that she existed.  He just stood there and dripped, as he did day after day, his attention entirely on the world inside the basin, trapped within his own self-absorption. <br/> <br/>So she closed her eyes, and once more let her dream take her away.</td>', 'For many lonely nights she stood there, wrapped in gossamer flow, billowing in the breeze from the window beyond.  In her dreams it was always the same, she would stand there in the light of the dawn, and he would gaze at her from across the expanse of the sink, and a smile would form on his face, and she would smile back, but only slightly.  They would flirt like this for awhile, and eventually he would come to her and take her hand, and they would begin a waltz across the formica, away from the stainless steal and into a happiness untold. But that was only in her dreams.  As she stood there once more, and gazed across the sink, she saw that once more he would not even acknowledge that she existed.  He just stood there and dripped, as he did day after day, his attention entirely on the world inside the basin, trapped within his own self-absorption.  So she closed her eyes, and once more let her dream take her away.', '2009-02-03 13:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5237072, 761657, 97166, '<td valign="top">Hey mom! Hey Mom!  Mom. Mom? mom. Mom! Mom. Hey mom. Look. Look mom. Mom? look. Mom? look mom.  Mom look. Mom? Hey mom! Look. Mom. Look. Mom?<br/> <br/>FOR THE LOVE OF PETE HARRY, WHAT!?<br/> <br/>I just ate some seafood!  See?  FOOD!<br/> <br/>Go to your room Harry.</td>', 'Hey mom! Hey Mom!  Mom. Mom? mom. Mom! Mom. Hey mom. Look. Look mom. Mom? look. Mom? look mom.  Mom look. Mom? Hey mom! Look. Mom. Look. Mom? FOR THE LOVE OF PETE HARRY, WHAT!? I just ate some seafood!  See?  FOOD! Go to your room Harry.', '2009-02-03 13:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5237083, 761312, 97166, '<td valign="top">They had never known such horror before, but when it happened, it devastated them all.  The strange object that had entered their world had suddenly become the last bastion of hope in a desperate attempt at survival.  They clung to it with all their strength.  Who would be the next to finally fatigue and let go, to be sent screaming to their doom?<br/> <br/>They all watched as countless others shot towards the surface, only to explode violently there.  They all watched as one by one, the bubbles they were with lost their grips and went toward the same fate.  They all watched as friends and family were obliterated.<br/> <br/>Why? Why was this happening? What force, or god, or entity could possibly be so cruel as to doom them to this fate?  For what purpose? For what reason?<br/> <br/>They would never know, and on that horrible day, the screams were endless.</td>', 'They had never known such horror before, but when it happened, it devastated them all.  The strange object that had entered their world had suddenly become the last bastion of hope in a desperate attempt at survival.  They clung to it with all their strength.  Who would be the next to finally fatigue and let go, to be sent screaming to their doom? They all watched as countless others shot towards the surface, only to explode violently there.  They all watched as one by one, the bubbles they were with lost their grips and went toward the same fate.  They all watched as friends and family were obliterated. Why? Why was this happening? What force, or god, or entity could possibly be so cruel as to doom them to this fate?  For what purpose? For what reason? They would never know, and on that horrible day, the screams were endless.', '2009-02-03 13:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5237088, 759151, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the unusual composition and the extreme low angle in this. The trees in the background are great and the moon is a great visual detail. I feel that this would be stronger if it were just a little brighter.</td>', 'I love the unusual composition and the extreme low angle in this. The trees in the background are great and the moon is a great visual detail. I feel that this would be stronger if it were just a little brighter.', '2009-02-03 13:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5237090, 761531, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great soft lighting, cute outfits and adorable subjects. A slightly tighter crop on the bottom would emphasize their pink outfits a little more for me.</td>', 'Great soft lighting, cute outfits and adorable subjects. A slightly tighter crop on the bottom would emphasize their pink outfits a little more for me.', '2009-02-03 13:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5237091, 757170, 98141, '<td valign="top">Abstract but interesting, I''m glad that one "stripe" is a differnt shade than the rest. Looking forward to reading about this one!</td>', 'Abstract but interesting, I''m glad that one "stripe" is a differnt shade than the rest. Looking forward to reading about this one!', '2009-02-03 13:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5237092, 755487, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this. I think a less-centered horizon would make it more powerful. I would love to see more of that gorgeous sky.</td>', 'I love the colors in this. I think a less-centered horizon would make it more powerful. I would love to see more of that gorgeous sky.', '2009-02-03 13:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5237094, 761503, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think that if the blossom were not in the center that this would be much more visually engaging.</td>', 'I think that if the blossom were not in the center that this would be much more visually engaging.', '2009-02-03 13:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5237111, 761044, 97166, '<td valign="top">Perhaps they''d thought it all in good fun, perhaps they simply chose not to notice the look on the face, or to hear the desperation in the pleas to stop, to not throw anymore.   Perhaps they just got carried away.<br/> <br/>Perhaps, but sometimes the games of winter can turn ugly before you know it, and sometimes one goes away with a tear on the cheek and feeling more than just the pain of stinging ice on their skin. <br/> <br/>Sometimes it can be so hard to navigate the landscape that is childhood, especially when that landscape can be cold and unforgiving.</td>', 'Perhaps they''d thought it all in good fun, perhaps they simply chose not to notice the look on the face, or to hear the desperation in the pleas to stop, to not throw anymore.   Perhaps they just got carried away. Perhaps, but sometimes the games of winter can turn ugly before you know it, and sometimes one goes away with a tear on the cheek and feeling more than just the pain of stinging ice on their skin.  Sometimes it can be so hard to navigate the landscape that is childhood, especially when that landscape can be cold and unforgiving.', '2009-02-03 13:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5237112, 759577, 98141, '<td valign="top">Fantastic lighting and reflection. Good clarity.</td>', 'Fantastic lighting and reflection. Good clarity.', '2009-02-03 13:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5237113, 761625, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great DOF, interesting composition and nice colors. Nice macro.</td>', 'Great DOF, interesting composition and nice colors. Nice macro.', '2009-02-03 13:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5237115, 761617, 97166, '<td valign="top">Paul was embarrassed, later, to find out that Francis was actually out shopping that morning.<br/> <br/>He swore never to take viagara with his morning orange juice ever again.</td>', 'Paul was embarrassed, later, to find out that Francis was actually out shopping that morning. He swore never to take viagara with his morning orange juice ever again.', '2009-02-03 13:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5237122, 755831, 97166, '<td valign="top">On a warm sunny day, with the cares of most people lost in the sand and the warmth of the water and the joy of the afternoon, they came.<br/> <br/>Every one of them colored uniquely, every one of them causing pointed fingers and gasps of awe.  <br/> <br/>At first the people smiled and laughed, thinking it some kind of event, some kind of show.  The smiles and laughter soon turned to shock and screams, however, as these floating things, these colorful monstrosities, soon started shooting threads down at the people below. Threads like gossamer web, but strong as tempered steel. Threads that pierced those they touched, and carried them screaming into the skies.<br/> <br/>Humanity would suddenly find themselves in a fight for their very existence.</td>', 'On a warm sunny day, with the cares of most people lost in the sand and the warmth of the water and the joy of the afternoon, they came. Every one of them colored uniquely, every one of them causing pointed fingers and gasps of awe.   At first the people smiled and laughed, thinking it some kind of event, some kind of show.  The smiles and laughter soon turned to shock and screams, however, as these floating things, these colorful monstrosities, soon started shooting threads down at the people below. Threads like gossamer web, but strong as tempered steel. Threads that pierced those they touched, and carried them screaming into the skies. Humanity would suddenly find themselves in a fight for their very existence.', '2009-02-03 13:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
