(5239170, 761117, 56502, '<td valign="top">My idea is that her face should be brighter than her bottom, how it is now I find it distracting. Or have her pose in a way that bottom and feet are hidden behind her face.</td>', 'My idea is that her face should be brighter than her bottom, how it is now I find it distracting. Or have her pose in a way that bottom and feet are hidden behind her face.', '2009-02-04 12:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239310, 761598, 52500, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  I like it.  When it first popped up I thought I saw a face in there, but I lost it almost immediately.  This really just has a nice, soft, comfy feel to it.  Except for the shallow DOF this feels like a pinhole shot.  Wait a minute!  Maybe it''s a Lensbaby shot with the pinhole optic!  Or maybe not. :)</td>', 'Hmmm.  I like it.  When it first popped up I thought I saw a face in there, but I lost it almost immediately.  This really just has a nice, soft, comfy feel to it.  Except for the shallow DOF this feels like a pinhole shot.  Wait a minute!  Maybe it''s a Lensbaby shot with the pinhole optic!  Or maybe not. :)', '2009-02-04 14:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239314, 756100, 52500, '<td valign="top">Holy tonemapping, Batman!  I like the look, but I miss some sharpness.  I can''t really tell if the focus is off or if there''s some motion blur or something, but it ain''t quite right for me.  Still, pretty cool looking.</td>', 'Holy tonemapping, Batman!  I like the look, but I miss some sharpness.  I can''t really tell if the focus is off or if there''s some motion blur or something, but it ain''t quite right for me.  Still, pretty cool looking.', '2009-02-04 14:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239317, 761275, 52500, '<td valign="top">Poor guy.  Someone''s been chewing on his ear.  And he seems to have been painted blue.  All of the blown out white turned grey looks kinda weird, too.  It''s a good capture, but I''m not too fond of the end result.</td>', 'Poor guy.  Someone''s been chewing on his ear.  And he seems to have been painted blue.  All of the blown out white turned grey looks kinda weird, too.  It''s a good capture, but I''m not too fond of the end result.', '2009-02-04 14:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239349, 753025, 91998, '<td valign="top">Really like this one, different to many of the shots you see of big cats. Very sharp too.</td>', 'Really like this one, different to many of the shots you see of big cats. Very sharp too.', '2009-02-04 14:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239355, 759864, 91998, '<td valign="top">I like this pic, with the dark sky could have been submitted into the Ansel Adams challenge. I''ll be interested to know where this is. I''m going to guess at N. Wales.</td>', 'I like this pic, with the dark sky could have been submitted into the Ansel Adams challenge. I''ll be interested to know where this is. I''m going to guess at N. Wales.', '2009-02-04 14:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239359, 761606, 91998, '<td valign="top">Brilliant colours, especially on the rust. Reminded me of fuji velia in the old 35mm film days :D. I like the angle too. I''m giving an 8</td>', 'Brilliant colours, especially on the rust. Reminded me of fuji velia in the old 35mm film days :D. I like the angle too. I''m giving an 8', '2009-02-04 14:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
