(5239693, 760475, 100773, '<td valign="top">Uhm, I... uhm.. I was just... I don''t know what to say. I... Seriously! I can''t take my eyes of this photo. I was just going to vote on some photos before I went to bed, and know I''ve been sitting here watching this one for at least 10 minutes! I have to stop writing now and vote. 10 and favorite from me. So beautifull!</td>', 'Uhm, I... uhm.. I was just... I don''t know what to say. I... Seriously! I can''t take my eyes of this photo. I was just going to vote on some photos before I went to bed, and know I''ve been sitting here watching this one for at least 10 minutes! I have to stop writing now and vote. 10 and favorite from me. So beautifull!', '2009-02-04 18:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239695, 760881, 100773, '<td valign="top">Good composing and use of color, but I''m not sure with the noise behind your motive. It looks artificifal.</td>', 'Good composing and use of color, but I''m not sure with the noise behind your motive. It looks artificifal.', '2009-02-04 18:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239714, 760825, 100773, '<td valign="top">Don''t go, Mr. Dog! Stay! This composition tells a story, and I will probably dream the rest of it tonight because it really touched me. I would like to see more sharpness and maybe the right side of the photo is a bit bright.</td>', 'Don''t go, Mr. Dog! Stay! This composition tells a story, and I will probably dream the rest of it tonight because it really touched me. I would like to see more sharpness and maybe the right side of the photo is a bit bright.', '2009-02-04 18:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
