(5241818, 759386, 29269, '<td valign="top">Light is great, love the high-key here. Focus - perfect. Shallow depth works well. However, that reflection/the shape of it/the eyes, is unnerving. I can see how you could have gotten that with two rectangular softboxes, - really, it doesn''t matter how, it is weird. I''d have taken another one, or played down the vertical line in the eyes. But that''s just me. Great photo, nevertheless.</td>', 'Light is great, love the high-key here. Focus - perfect. Shallow depth works well. However, that reflection/the shape of it/the eyes, is unnerving. I can see how you could have gotten that with two rectangular softboxes, - really, it doesn''t matter how, it is weird. I''d have taken another one, or played down the vertical line in the eyes. But that''s just me. Great photo, nevertheless.', '2009-02-06 00:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5241820, 761557, 29269, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried shooting the moon in the past, and I can sure appreciate the skill and the effort necessary to come up with this one. However, I''m afraid that DPC will require more for a free study entry and score this in the high 5s range. I''ll try to alleviate that by a little bit. Great job!</td>', 'I''ve tried shooting the moon in the past, and I can sure appreciate the skill and the effort necessary to come up with this one. However, I''m afraid that DPC will require more for a free study entry and score this in the high 5s range. I''ll try to alleviate that by a little bit. Great job!', '2009-02-06 00:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5241828, 760113, 29269, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!<br/> <br/>btw, it feels like a huge black hole, the lower-right of the photo. I''d rather see you either cropping a bit off of your elbow and rotating slightly cw, or adding more negative space to the left to balance out the right side.<br/>Good luck with the challenge!<br/>-S.</td>', 'Congratulations! btw, it feels like a huge black hole, the lower-right of the photo. I''d rather see you either cropping a bit off of your elbow and rotating slightly cw, or adding more negative space to the left to balance out the right side.Good luck with the challenge!-S.', '2009-02-06 00:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
