(5242101, 761110, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for these long exposure beach shots ... waves, gulls and somebody running, all blurred into an overly-sweet charm.  It''s like visual Abba music, and I can''t help singing along every time.  This is an especially good one.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for these long exposure beach shots ... waves, gulls and somebody running, all blurred into an overly-sweet charm.  It''s like visual Abba music, and I can''t help singing along every time.  This is an especially good one.', '2009-02-06 07:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
