(5242118, 760009, 100773, '<td valign="top">Looks like a very difficult subject to shoot, lighting and everything taken in concideration, but something is not quite right. Since I can''t think of a better word, the mountainsides you have shot looks a bit shabby. It looks like you have had a little bit to slow shutterspeed and tried to handheld the camera. Sorry...</td>', 'Looks like a very difficult subject to shoot, lighting and everything taken in concideration, but something is not quite right. Since I can''t think of a better word, the mountainsides you have shot looks a bit shabby. It looks like you have had a little bit to slow shutterspeed and tried to handheld the camera. Sorry...', '2009-02-06 07:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5242121, 761542, 100773, '<td valign="top">Very funny! Is nice voting your way through 400 entries when something like this comes along. Love the "colors" in this one, and that the two of them have the same grin.</td>', 'Very funny! Is nice voting your way through 400 entries when something like this comes along. Love the "colors" in this one, and that the two of them have the same grin.', '2009-02-06 07:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
