(5242127, 760583, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is so wonderfully cool.  I hate using that word, but in this case it''s exactly the right word because the photograph reminds me of the ''counter-art'' art of the late 1960''s, and it was <i>very cool</i>.  It may have been the early 1970''s  I know I was there, but I don''t remember it too clearly.  Anyway, the deadpan ordinariness of this picture is ... extraordinary!  Which is the point of course.  8.</td>', 'This is so wonderfully cool.  I hate using that word, but in this case it''s exactly the right word because the photograph reminds me of the ''counter-art'' art of the late 1960''s, and it was very cool.  It may have been the early 1970''s  I know I was there, but I don''t remember it too clearly.  Anyway, the deadpan ordinariness of this picture is ... extraordinary!  Which is the point of course.  8.', '2009-02-06 07:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
