(5242577, 761427, 30049, '<td valign="top">Les (<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=52449" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">AperturePriority</a>) - This should complete your PB list with a clean sweep of this location.  :-)  Good luck.  One of my top picks in this challenge with this wonderful capture.<br/> <br/>Hmmm...wait a minute, this could be Jimmy (<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=34659" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">SJCarter</a>) also.  Then neither one.  :-/  Well, WHOEVER took this photo, you did a very nice job with it.  :-)</td>', 'Les ( AperturePriority) - This should complete your PB list with a clean sweep of this location.  :-)  Good luck.  One of my top picks in this challenge with this wonderful capture. Hmmm...wait a minute, this could be Jimmy ( SJCarter) also.  Then neither one.  :-/  Well, WHOEVER took this photo, you did a very nice job with it.  :-)', '2009-02-06 15:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
