(5243274, 760475, 5391, '<td valign="top">Absolutely lovely.  Great job in creating the feeling of a painting.  9</td>', 'Absolutely lovely.  Great job in creating the feeling of a painting.  9', '2009-02-07 00:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243279, 759999, 5391, '<td valign="top">Lovely. This has a surreal feeling while holding on to natural colors and not feeling overly processed.  9</td>', 'Lovely. This has a surreal feeling while holding on to natural colors and not feeling overly processed.  9', '2009-02-07 00:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243283, 760058, 5391, '<td valign="top">Wow - beautiful colors and perspective.  9</td>', 'Wow - beautiful colors and perspective.  9', '2009-02-07 00:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243291, 761566, 5391, '<td valign="top">Lovely environmental portrait - nice connection between the subjects, genuine emotion/feeling, and good exposure considering it would have been very easy to expose for the background and underexpose the subjects.  A lot of people will mark this lower because it''s not something you''d hang on your wall, but it really conveys the heart of the woman and her love for what she does.  8</td>', 'Lovely environmental portrait - nice connection between the subjects, genuine emotion/feeling, and good exposure considering it would have been very easy to expose for the background and underexpose the subjects.  A lot of people will mark this lower because it''s not something you''d hang on your wall, but it really conveys the heart of the woman and her love for what she does.  8', '2009-02-07 00:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243321, 761096, 42013, '<td valign="top">Excellent work!</td>', 'Excellent work!', '2009-02-07 01:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243322, 754832, 42013, '<td valign="top">BG complements the subject perfectly!</td>', 'BG complements the subject perfectly!', '2009-02-07 01:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243324, 761417, 42013, '<td valign="top">Andi? or another of the LB freaks! ;) This is pretty cool!<br/> <br/>The blurring is reminiscent of the movement of waves over sand, like the whole picture is in motion.</td>', 'Andi? or another of the LB freaks! ;) This is pretty cool! The blurring is reminiscent of the movement of waves over sand, like the whole picture is in motion.', '2009-02-07 01:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243326, 759517, 42013, '<td valign="top">Tell your GF to give you more credit! ;) Love your shot!</td>', 'Tell your GF to give you more credit! ;) Love your shot!', '2009-02-07 01:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243344, 758667, 99448, '<td valign="top">This looks really interesting, and I''d love to know what it is.</td>', 'This looks really interesting, and I''d love to know what it is.', '2009-02-07 03:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243347, 753400, 99448, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve done a great job of combining the long time exposure foreground, with a very sharp background. This combined with beautiful rich colours really makes it pop and for me is a 9</td>', 'I think you''ve done a great job of combining the long time exposure foreground, with a very sharp background. This combined with beautiful rich colours really makes it pop and for me is a 9', '2009-02-07 03:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243349, 759268, 99448, '<td valign="top">A really nice shot, I would have preferred the horizon to be more level but still a very good job</td>', 'A really nice shot, I would have preferred the horizon to be more level but still a very good job', '2009-02-07 03:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243352, 759506, 99448, '<td valign="top">What a great shot and a very interesting capture. But IMO I think it would have been more striking without the dust as it draws my eye awy from a really excellent subject. 8</td>', 'What a great shot and a very interesting capture. But IMO I think it would have been more striking without the dust as it draws my eye awy from a really excellent subject. 8', '2009-02-07 03:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243354, 760710, 99448, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, when I look at the title it makes me sing the Fratellis song Chelsea Dagger lol. Great song great image. 8</td>', 'Great portrait, when I look at the title it makes me sing the Fratellis song Chelsea Dagger lol. Great song great image. 8', '2009-02-07 03:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243356, 753011, 99448, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, love the retro feel the bottle gives it</td>', 'Interesting shot, love the retro feel the bottle gives it', '2009-02-07 03:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243357, 754713, 99448, '<td valign="top">This has a really old feel to it. Good job</td>', 'This has a really old feel to it. Good job', '2009-02-07 03:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243359, 761249, 99448, '<td valign="top">Wow this is a real postcard / Poster capture and one you could lok at all day. Good job.</td>', 'Wow this is a real postcard / Poster capture and one you could lok at all day. Good job.', '2009-02-07 03:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243361, 758983, 67258, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!!!</td>', 'Wonderful!!!', '2009-02-07 03:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243363, 761037, 99448, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and great DOF</td>', 'Love the colours and great DOF', '2009-02-07 03:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243365, 753946, 99448, '<td valign="top">I bet you get lots of comments about it being blown out, but for me this really works and wouldn''t have been as striking with a shorter exposure. 8</td>', 'I bet you get lots of comments about it being blown out, but for me this really works and wouldn''t have been as striking with a shorter exposure. 8', '2009-02-07 03:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243367, 761625, 99448, '<td valign="top">Wow, the detail you''ve captured in the wings is staggering</td>', 'Wow, the detail you''ve captured in the wings is staggering', '2009-02-07 03:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243368, 761527, 99448, '<td valign="top">Perfect crop</td>', 'Perfect crop', '2009-02-07 03:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243371, 755523, 99448, '<td valign="top">This just works. I love the way the rinkles in the duvet fit in with the cracks and uneveness of the walls, and the curtain along with the labbie just make this outstanding. 10</td>', 'This just works. I love the way the rinkles in the duvet fit in with the cracks and uneveness of the walls, and the curtain along with the labbie just make this outstanding. 10', '2009-02-07 03:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243400, 755523, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a thoroughly interesting image, such a story for the viewer to weave and explore.  And in addition the technicals are superb!</td>', 'What a thoroughly interesting image, such a story for the viewer to weave and explore.  And in addition the technicals are superb!', '2009-02-07 05:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243401, 760909, 67258, '<td valign="top">And what wonderful inspiration she must be!  The intensity of that gaze entrances me.  I love everything about this photo.</td>', 'And what wonderful inspiration she must be!  The intensity of that gaze entrances me.  I love everything about this photo.', '2009-02-07 05:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243402, 761440, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a really lovely and absorbing image.  Windows are so often something special in a photograph; they are the place where two worlds meet.  And that''s what I feel about this photograph ... that it''s about two worlds, perhaps in conflict, maybe even in opposition.  I feel certain, alas, that the shadows across the face, and especially across the mouth, are no accident.  So it''s a powerful and unsettling photograph.</td>', 'This is a really lovely and absorbing image.  Windows are so often something special in a photograph; they are the place where two worlds meet.  And that''s what I feel about this photograph ... that it''s about two worlds, perhaps in conflict, maybe even in opposition.  I feel certain, alas, that the shadows across the face, and especially across the mouth, are no accident.  So it''s a powerful and unsettling photograph.', '2009-02-07 05:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243403, 761271, 30364, '<td valign="top">This striking geometric coincidence is so unusual and even improbable, that it is somehow let down a little by the very bottom bit being so ordinary.  But then again, maybe that''s a good thing?  Maybe the outrageous optimism of the top 95% needs the other 5% just to remind us that no matter how divine and celestial a thing appears to be, it''s all just man''s works in the end.  9.</td>', 'This striking geometric coincidence is so unusual and even improbable, that it is somehow let down a little by the very bottom bit being so ordinary.  But then again, maybe that''s a good thing?  Maybe the outrageous optimism of the top 95% needs the other 5% just to remind us that no matter how divine and celestial a thing appears to be, it''s all just man''s works in the end.  9.', '2009-02-07 05:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243404, 757049, 67258, '<td valign="top">A lovely image that encapsulates both a sense of loss, and of memories remembered.  Tender, sympathetic, sad but also very lovely.  A very fitting tribute to your parents;  I hope the crafting of it helped, in some small way, to steer you through this difficult time.</td>', 'A lovely image that encapsulates both a sense of loss, and of memories remembered.  Tender, sympathetic, sad but also very lovely.  A very fitting tribute to your parents;  I hope the crafting of it helped, in some small way, to steer you through this difficult time.', '2009-02-07 05:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243406, 761044, 67258, '<td valign="top">A photo with real impact.  As a viewer I am challenged by the narrative presented - the child, so close to the photographer, but in a world quite separate; the adults at the steps who at first seem incidental but are actually quite integral to the picture as a whole; the rail that acts as a very effective barrier between the child and the others.  The sense of isolation, solitariness, inability to understand the adult world is palpable.  I think that I am sometimes that child.</td>', 'A photo with real impact.  As a viewer I am challenged by the narrative presented - the child, so close to the photographer, but in a world quite separate; the adults at the steps who at first seem incidental but are actually quite integral to the picture as a whole; the rail that acts as a very effective barrier between the child and the others.  The sense of isolation, solitariness, inability to understand the adult world is palpable.  I think that I am sometimes that child.', '2009-02-07 05:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243407, 761591, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice portrait ... actually self-portrait, because I know who it is.  So I should abstain I suppose but I have already pressed the number &amp; I don''t know how to un-vote.  But if I didn''t know who it is, I''d say it''s a natural, understated and professional work, simple and all the more effective for that, and deserved at least the 7 that I gave it.</td>', 'This is a very nice portrait ... actually self-portrait, because I know who it is.  So I should abstain I suppose but I have already pressed the number & I don''t know how to un-vote.  But if I didn''t know who it is, I''d say it''s a natural, understated and professional work, simple and all the more effective for that, and deserved at least the 7 that I gave it.', '2009-02-07 05:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243408, 760849, 30364, '<td valign="top">Someone (I think it was Eugène Atget) took a great photograph of Notre Dame through the branches of a tree.  Yep, found it ... <a href="//images.google.com/imgres?imgurl=//www.masters-of-photography.com/images/full/atget/atget_notre_dame.jpg&amp;imgrefurl=//www.masters-of-photography.com/A/atget/atget_notre_dame_full.html&amp;usg=__rWlvP5SIydG4JAipQ9ExbS80UWs=&amp;h=480&amp;w=638&amp;sz=92&amp;hl=en&amp;start=22&amp;um=1&amp;tbnid=Pk_7VDUhOPHJyM:&amp;tbnh=103&amp;tbnw=137&amp;prev=/images%3Fq%3Deugene%2Batget%26start%3D18%26ndsp%3D18%26um%3D1%26hl%3Den%26client%3Dsafari%26rls%3Den-us%26sa%3DN" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here.</a>  Yours is similar and has the same quality of lightness and even delicacy, which is quite an achievement when the buildings are in reality so monolithic.  I suppose it''s been done by someone else in between Atget &amp; you, but yours is the first one I can recall seeing (I think) and the best one (I''m certain).  8.<br/> <br/>P.S.  Had you seen the Atget shot?</td>', 'Someone (I think it was Eugène Atget) took a great photograph of Notre Dame through the branches of a tree.  Yep, found it ... here.  Yours is similar and has the same quality of lightness and even delicacy, which is quite an achievement when the buildings are in reality so monolithic.  I suppose it''s been done by someone else in between Atget & you, but yours is the first one I can recall seeing (I think) and the best one (I''m certain).  8. P.S.  Had you seen the Atget shot?', '2009-02-07 06:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243410, 754603, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is very good.  The flag and the turn tracks must have been inviting, and you accepted their invitation beautifully.<br/>Made me think of Sonny Fai too, who was lost not far beyond that horizon.</td>', 'This is very good.  The flag and the turn tracks must have been inviting, and you accepted their invitation beautifully.Made me think of Sonny Fai too, who was lost not far beyond that horizon.', '2009-02-07 06:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243411, 760856, 30364, '<td valign="top">It does convey exactly what your title says.  It''s an uncomplicated, lovely picture.</td>', 'It does convey exactly what your title says.  It''s an uncomplicated, lovely picture.', '2009-02-07 06:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243412, 761569, 30364, '<td valign="top">An appealing, natural portrait that proves that genuine feeling is the most important ingredient for making a durable portrait.  The fact that both the light and the focus are a little more emphatic on the child than on the mother is a sublime touch, and adds a level of meaning and emotional depth that wouldn''t be possible with ''even'' treatment.  I hope that that choice was intentional, because it elevates this well above the standard ''professional studio'' fare.  8.</td>', 'An appealing, natural portrait that proves that genuine feeling is the most important ingredient for making a durable portrait.  The fact that both the light and the focus are a little more emphatic on the child than on the mother is a sublime touch, and adds a level of meaning and emotional depth that wouldn''t be possible with ''even'' treatment.  I hope that that choice was intentional, because it elevates this well above the standard ''professional studio'' fare.  8.', '2009-02-07 06:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243416, 761426, 30364, '<td valign="top">The horizontal division suggests two worlds; the upper one clean and productive and utopian, and the lower one wanton and confrontational and unavailing.  This young man seems to be considering the options.  Or perhaps, having made his choice, considering his future. I like photographs as allegory and this is a particularly good one.  8.</td>', 'The horizontal division suggests two worlds; the upper one clean and productive and utopian, and the lower one wanton and confrontational and unavailing.  This young man seems to be considering the options.  Or perhaps, having made his choice, considering his future. I like photographs as allegory and this is a particularly good one.  8.', '2009-02-07 06:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243424, 761252, 88204, '<td valign="top">Intriguing composition. Curious expression goes well with the composition. 8</td>', 'Intriguing composition. Curious expression goes well with the composition. 8', '2009-02-07 06:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243426, 759373, 88204, '<td valign="top">I love the emphasis on blue tones in this... kind of retro. The light is interesting coming from both sides... it''s a little odd to have the dark spots in the eyes and around the nose but it makes it a bit quirky, which I like. The centered composition adds to it. Well done! 8</td>', 'I love the emphasis on blue tones in this... kind of retro. The light is interesting coming from both sides... it''s a little odd to have the dark spots in the eyes and around the nose but it makes it a bit quirky, which I like. The centered composition adds to it. Well done! 8', '2009-02-07 06:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243427, 755523, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great composition, use of limited color and soft light. What an interesting room. 8</td>', 'Great composition, use of limited color and soft light. What an interesting room. 8', '2009-02-07 06:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243428, 759282, 88204, '<td valign="top">Leading lines draw you right in. Red on red works great. Nice casual expression and pose. Limited depth of field pulls you right to the subject. Mossimo and red... Target rocks! All you need is a nice white bullseye in the lower left corner and you have a great Target ad.  :)   Well done. 8</td>', 'Leading lines draw you right in. Red on red works great. Nice casual expression and pose. Limited depth of field pulls you right to the subject. Mossimo and red... Target rocks! All you need is a nice white bullseye in the lower left corner and you have a great Target ad.  :)   Well done. 8', '2009-02-07 06:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243429, 760577, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great expression, clarity and sparkle in the eyes, nice off center composition and simple background. Clean and simple... very nice! 8</td>', 'Great expression, clarity and sparkle in the eyes, nice off center composition and simple background. Clean and simple... very nice! 8', '2009-02-07 06:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243430, 761549, 88204, '<td valign="top">Cool mood. I like the off-center composition.</td>', 'Cool mood. I like the off-center composition.', '2009-02-07 06:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243431, 761356, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wow! Beautiful girl. Nice use of white and black. Nice composition and pose. Excellent lighting to emphasize her beauty and shape. 8</td>', 'Wow! Beautiful girl. Nice use of white and black. Nice composition and pose. Excellent lighting to emphasize her beauty and shape. 8', '2009-02-07 06:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243432, 760293, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Very unsettling to see this innocent little girl heading into some creepy woods. It helps the mood that her back is to us... makes it more intriguing. Dramatic post processing adds to the uneasy feeling. Well done. 8</td>', 'Great shot. Very unsettling to see this innocent little girl heading into some creepy woods. It helps the mood that her back is to us... makes it more intriguing. Dramatic post processing adds to the uneasy feeling. Well done. 8', '2009-02-07 07:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243435, 759552, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great soft lighting. Composition and angle work well. Great expression and smile on a beautiful girl. Her hair looks a tad wind blown on top which is a slight distraction. I think I would have cropped a little tighter, possibly to an almost square composition since the background is blurred and not especially important to the shot, which would have brought out her face and smile that much more. Well done! 8</td>', 'Great soft lighting. Composition and angle work well. Great expression and smile on a beautiful girl. Her hair looks a tad wind blown on top which is a slight distraction. I think I would have cropped a little tighter, possibly to an almost square composition since the background is blurred and not especially important to the shot, which would have brought out her face and smile that much more. Well done! 8', '2009-02-07 07:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243436, 761214, 88204, '<td valign="top">I love the dramatic lighting and sparkling eyes! Well done!</td>', 'I love the dramatic lighting and sparkling eyes! Well done!', '2009-02-07 07:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243438, 753946, 88204, '<td valign="top">Cool contrast of curves and lines. Love the white on white.</td>', 'Cool contrast of curves and lines. Love the white on white.', '2009-02-07 07:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243440, 761117, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great composition... the focus is the face but you can wander around the frame and see other interesting parts. I wish there was a little more light on the face and eyes. I like the lines on the floor to pull you into thte shot. 8</td>', 'Great composition... the focus is the face but you can wander around the frame and see other interesting parts. I wish there was a little more light on the face and eyes. I like the lines on the floor to pull you into thte shot. 8', '2009-02-07 07:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243442, 761460, 88204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes. I like the contrast of soft skin with the hard background.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes. I like the contrast of soft skin with the hard background.', '2009-02-07 07:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243443, 761554, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great warm light. I like the rim lighting on her face.</td>', 'Great warm light. I like the rim lighting on her face.', '2009-02-07 07:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243444, 760642, 88204, '<td valign="top">Simple elegance and beauty. I assume you used a diffuse glow type filter which works very well to emphasize an ethereal softness. 8</td>', 'Simple elegance and beauty. I assume you used a diffuse glow type filter which works very well to emphasize an ethereal softness. 8', '2009-02-07 07:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243445, 758687, 100393, '<td valign="top">Very unusual and well executed portrait.</td>', 'Very unusual and well executed portrait.', '2009-02-07 07:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243446, 761044, 100393, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this - composition, lighting, story, colour! I fear it won''t score as well as I think it should. A 9 from me.</td>', 'I LOVE this - composition, lighting, story, colour! I fear it won''t score as well as I think it should. A 9 from me.', '2009-02-07 07:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243447, 756100, 100393, '<td valign="top">This is a real stand-out portrait.</td>', 'This is a real stand-out portrait.', '2009-02-07 07:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243448, 757336, 100393, '<td valign="top">Spectacular - just when I thought I couldn''t be wow-ed with any more water drop shots - along comes this. All the more impressive because of our long exposure to such shots.</td>', 'Spectacular - just when I thought I couldn''t be wow-ed with any more water drop shots - along comes this. All the more impressive because of our long exposure to such shots.', '2009-02-07 07:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243449, 761117, 100393, '<td valign="top">The point of focus is just in front of the model - it doesn''t escape me that one way to remedy that would be for the viewer (camera) to move closer, thus reinforcing the meaning within the shot. Great work.</td>', 'The point of focus is just in front of the model - it doesn''t escape me that one way to remedy that would be for the viewer (camera) to move closer, thus reinforcing the meaning within the shot. Great work.', '2009-02-07 07:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243450, 755178, 100393, '<td valign="top">Really interesting image - this is technically very intriguing; leaves me wondering what lens? was it software corrected? HDR? How many exposures? Was there a shift in focus between them to get an extended DOF?<br/> <br/>Or am I overcomplicating the shot - whatever, it''s a great result.</td>', 'Really interesting image - this is technically very intriguing; leaves me wondering what lens? was it software corrected? HDR? How many exposures? Was there a shift in focus between them to get an extended DOF? Or am I overcomplicating the shot - whatever, it''s a great result.', '2009-02-07 07:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243451, 760887, 100393, '<td valign="top">You get the impression that every element in this shot has been subject to a choice as to whether it should be black, white, or a very particular shade of grey. I should add - I think this is a good thing! It makes the image feel crafted rather than simply shot.</td>', 'You get the impression that every element in this shot has been subject to a choice as to whether it should be black, white, or a very particular shade of grey. I should add - I think this is a good thing! It makes the image feel crafted rather than simply shot.', '2009-02-07 07:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243458, 760821, 75192, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful. I really like it. 10. <br/> <br/>Best in challenge.</td>', 'This is wonderful. I really like it. 10.  Best in challenge.', '2009-02-07 07:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243499, 761580, 39880, '<td valign="top">I like the burst of color from the shoe over there on the left.  I could picture this as an ad somewhere.</td>', 'I like the burst of color from the shoe over there on the left.  I could picture this as an ad somewhere.', '2009-02-07 09:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243500, 761435, 39880, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit blurry.  Sharper focus would help.</td>', 'Looks a bit blurry.  Sharper focus would help.', '2009-02-07 09:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243502, 756841, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nice picture and I like the lighting.  I think the eyes could be a bit sharper.  Looks kind of soft.</td>', 'Nice picture and I like the lighting.  I think the eyes could be a bit sharper.  Looks kind of soft.', '2009-02-07 09:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243506, 761337, 39880, '<td valign="top">Looks kind of blurry.  Sharpen it up and it''s a nice shot.</td>', 'Looks kind of blurry.  Sharpen it up and it''s a nice shot.', '2009-02-07 09:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243521, 761044, 12076, '<td valign="top">every time I look at this I bump the score up a notch.  Currently at a 10 so that''s the best I can do.  Strange, surreal and unsettling.  Excellent!</td>', 'every time I look at this I bump the score up a notch.  Currently at a 10 so that''s the best I can do.  Strange, surreal and unsettling.  Excellent!', '2009-02-07 09:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
