(5243670, 761495, 100773, '<td valign="top">I keep looking at the top part of your photo instead of the playfull horse you have shot so beautifully. You would''ve gotten a much better presentation of this photo had cut away that dark branch and the sky at the top.</td>', 'I keep looking at the top part of your photo instead of the playfull horse you have shot so beautifully. You would''ve gotten a much better presentation of this photo had cut away that dark branch and the sky at the top.', '2009-02-07 12:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243675, 761600, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a lovely photo - and one that makes me thankful I am viewing it from the warmth of my house!</td>', 'What a lovely photo - and one that makes me thankful I am viewing it from the warmth of my house!', '2009-02-07 12:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243676, 759270, 67258, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, and a different take on this formation to other photos I have seen.</td>', 'Beautiful, and a different take on this formation to other photos I have seen.', '2009-02-07 12:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243678, 758667, 67258, '<td valign="top">I would hazard York Railway station - above Platform 8?  The twist and pattern of the roof pieces is quite magical. Yours is much more sharply focussed than <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=559008" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">mine</a> - hand held, or did you get permission to use a tripod?</td>', 'I would hazard York Railway station - above Platform 8?  The twist and pattern of the roof pieces is quite magical. Yours is much more sharply focussed than mine - hand held, or did you get permission to use a tripod?', '2009-02-07 12:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243681, 758983, 100773, '<td valign="top">When you take photos like this, try two differences exposures. The sea with its ways smashing against the rocks, BEAUTIFULL! The sky, and especially the mountain at the right side, get a little bit to light. Try one more exposure with a slower shutterspeed so the sky and the mountain appear more dramatic, and add that on top of the image with the slower shutterspeed, making the waves appear the way they did here. 6</td>', 'When you take photos like this, try two differences exposures. The sea with its ways smashing against the rocks, BEAUTIFULL! The sky, and especially the mountain at the right side, get a little bit to light. Try one more exposure with a slower shutterspeed so the sky and the mountain appear more dramatic, and add that on top of the image with the slower shutterspeed, making the waves appear the way they did here. 6', '2009-02-07 12:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243682, 753946, 67258, '<td valign="top">I love the use of the blinds for the background - adds a very pleasing twist to an oft used motif.  A very pleasing photograph.</td>', 'I love the use of the blinds for the background - adds a very pleasing twist to an oft used motif.  A very pleasing photograph.', '2009-02-07 12:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243683, 760847, 67258, '<td valign="top">The sort of image I love, and very well done indeed.</td>', 'The sort of image I love, and very well done indeed.', '2009-02-07 12:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243684, 760846, 100773, '<td valign="top">My first thought was "This looks the small creek behind my house", because it''s so small. I can imagine that there was a bit hard to get any closer, but this photo deserves to appear bigger.</td>', 'My first thought was "This looks the small creek behind my house", because it''s so small. I can imagine that there was a bit hard to get any closer, but this photo deserves to appear bigger.', '2009-02-07 12:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243685, 759999, 67258, '<td valign="top">Your rendering of the sky is superb - a quite magical landscape.</td>', 'Your rendering of the sky is superb - a quite magical landscape.', '2009-02-07 12:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243687, 761598, 67258, '<td valign="top">An image that sucks you in, slowly, slowly; I feel that I, and the flowers, am drowning, but happy - content, at peace.</td>', 'An image that sucks you in, slowly, slowly; I feel that I, and the flowers, am drowning, but happy - content, at peace.', '2009-02-07 12:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243688, 758997, 67258, '<td valign="top">Good detail, and a pleasingly coloured background that echoes the colours of the insects legs.</td>', 'Good detail, and a pleasingly coloured background that echoes the colours of the insects legs.', '2009-02-07 12:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243689, 756611, 67258, '<td valign="top">A very pleasing composition.  The third gull, with it;s head tucked under it''s wing certainly looks cold!</td>', 'A very pleasing composition.  The third gull, with it;s head tucked under it''s wing certainly looks cold!', '2009-02-07 12:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243690, 761341, 67258, '<td valign="top">The contrast between the quiet, almost serene, calm mannequin and the aggressive ''in your face'' pose of the model is well handled and provides for an interesting image.</td>', 'The contrast between the quiet, almost serene, calm mannequin and the aggressive ''in your face'' pose of the model is well handled and provides for an interesting image.', '2009-02-07 12:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243691, 761536, 100773, '<td valign="top">This somehow appears very strong. Fits perfectly to the music I listen to at the moment. 6</td>', 'This somehow appears very strong. Fits perfectly to the music I listen to at the moment. 6', '2009-02-07 12:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243693, 759014, 67258, '<td valign="top">The open beak, the angle of the head, and the difficult to get catch-light all combine to make this strong example of bird photography</td>', 'The open beak, the angle of the head, and the difficult to get catch-light all combine to make this strong example of bird photography', '2009-02-07 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243694, 760058, 100773, '<td valign="top">I got a little dizzy looking at this.</td>', 'I got a little dizzy looking at this.', '2009-02-07 12:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243695, 761037, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a great find!  I love the slipped ''O'' - it just seems so appropriate.  I guess this has been tone-mapped, and I feel the style suits the image well, although personally I would prefer a little more shadow.</td>', 'What a great find!  I love the slipped ''O'' - it just seems so appropriate.  I guess this has been tone-mapped, and I feel the style suits the image well, although personally I would prefer a little more shadow.', '2009-02-07 12:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243700, 759193, 100773, '<td valign="top">This needs some "spice", and sometimes that is the only thing between ok and perfect. This could be perfect! Longer shutterspeed on the waterfall, some processing on the mill so whatever colors apear stronger and a more dramatic sky would easily wind this challenge. Come back at night and you might be able to get all that. I really want to see that! Either you do it, or you tell me where it is so I can give it a shot ;)</td>', 'This needs some "spice", and sometimes that is the only thing between ok and perfect. This could be perfect! Longer shutterspeed on the waterfall, some processing on the mill so whatever colors apear stronger and a more dramatic sky would easily wind this challenge. Come back at night and you might be able to get all that. I really want to see that! Either you do it, or you tell me where it is so I can give it a shot ;)', '2009-02-07 12:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243702, 760897, 100773, '<td valign="top">Curse all of you who conjures so great colors! Lord knows I''ve tried! This is very beautifull!</td>', 'Curse all of you who conjures so great colors! Lord knows I''ve tried! This is very beautifull!', '2009-02-07 12:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
