(5243712, 759185, 42013, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot, processing, presentation. I guess I''m naive to a fault-- I can understand how this picture could be taken the wrong way but to me it seems very innocent. phylsy7 makes a good point but without you sharing that part of the story, the viewer is left to assume that you have a close relationship with the child and her parents. Dunno, can''t really explain my reaction... <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-09 13:54:17.</i></td>', 'Sweet shot, processing, presentation. I guess I''m naive to a fault-- I can understand how this picture could be taken the wrong way but to me it seems very innocent. phylsy7 makes a good point but without you sharing that part of the story, the viewer is left to assume that you have a close relationship with the child and her parents. Dunno, can''t really explain my reaction... ', '2009-02-07 13:01:08.000000', '2009-02-09 13:54:17.000000', 1),
