(5243907, 753019, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Wow.  Very nice.  Like your framing.  Maybe, a little more land at the bottom for additional balance - if it was there of course (and your call anyway, also ''of course'') - very, very minor - but looks like something poking up mid to right at the bottom of the frame - which could be why there is not more ''fore''.  Nice shapes, colors and elements.  Overall (and I noticed this at first too), could be a visual thing and/or perspective thing, but looks like it needs the thinnest whisker nudge rotate up on the right to straighten, or a perspective correction - perhaps more noticeable on the shape of the land in the distance on the left.  But you may find this all too ''nit-picky''... if so, just ignore ":)".</td>', '8 - Wow.  Very nice.  Like your framing.  Maybe, a little more land at the bottom for additional balance - if it was there of course (and your call anyway, also ''of course'') - very, very minor - but looks like something poking up mid to right at the bottom of the frame - which could be why there is not more ''fore''.  Nice shapes, colors and elements.  Overall (and I noticed this at first too), could be a visual thing and/or perspective thing, but looks like it needs the thinnest whisker nudge rotate up on the right to straighten, or a perspective correction - perhaps more noticeable on the shape of the land in the distance on the left.  But you may find this all too ''nit-picky''... if so, just ignore ":)".', '2009-02-07 15:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
