(5244609, 760475, 29011, '<td valign="top">Sunflowers and Pears! Both of my favorite still life subjects, and you got them in one shot ;) Beautiful capture. Excellent job with the lighting. Has a lovely soft feel to it, yet it is sharp. Great work. Very refreshing seeing a still life like this ribbon. +fave<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-08 00:20:01.</i></td>', 'Sunflowers and Pears! Both of my favorite still life subjects, and you got them in one shot ;) Beautiful capture. Excellent job with the lighting. Has a lovely soft feel to it, yet it is sharp. Great work. Very refreshing seeing a still life like this ribbon. +fave', '2009-02-08 00:19:20.000000', '2009-02-08 00:20:01.000000', 0),
