(5244623, 761427, 52449, '<td valign="top">Mike, that''s too funny that Barry thought this was one of my images. Barry was a teammate of mine in the WPL (World Photography League) here on DPC, so he knows my style. When I saw your photo, I thought, "hmmm...when did I take that?"  LOL!  At any rate, that''s an excellent photo!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-08 00:29:00.</i></td>', 'Mike, that''s too funny that Barry thought this was one of my images. Barry was a teammate of mine in the WPL (World Photography League) here on DPC, so he knows my style. When I saw your photo, I thought, "hmmm...when did I take that?"  LOL!  At any rate, that''s an excellent photo!', '2009-02-08 00:23:52.000000', '2009-02-08 00:29:00.000000', 0),
