(5244639, 759737, 68504, '<td valign="top">Tones, light and texture. Very strong.</td>', 'Tones, light and texture. Very strong.', '2009-02-08 00:29:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5244641, 759406, 67145, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful jeri .. dont let the tough voters put you off .. <br/>some of the most excellent images cop really bad scores .. <br/>the voters are often big on things like rule of thirds, forgetting sometimes that not following the rules can often be a better option ..  great if they followed their hearts more than their minds sometimes .. <br/>&amp; thankyou so much for that lovely surprise you left me in flickr .. i havent put them in .. but you made my day .. :)x</td>', 'this is beautiful jeri .. dont let the tough voters put you off .. some of the most excellent images cop really bad scores .. the voters are often big on things like rule of thirds, forgetting sometimes that not following the rules can often be a better option ..  great if they followed their hearts more than their minds sometimes .. & thankyou so much for that lovely surprise you left me in flickr .. i havent put them in .. but you made my day .. :)x', '2009-02-08 00:30:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5244643, 754159, 96915, '<td valign="top">In response to your post requesting feedback...<br/>I gave this a 6 during voting.  To me, it''s a "pretty" scene, but doesn''t really have enough to hold my attention.  The composition seems too centered for me.  Centered horizon, nearly centered lighthouse, and not much going on in the sky.  I do like how you''ve captured the spray coming off of the waves.</td>', 'In response to your post requesting feedback...I gave this a 6 during voting.  To me, it''s a "pretty" scene, but doesn''t really have enough to hold my attention.  The composition seems too centered for me.  Centered horizon, nearly centered lighthouse, and not much going on in the sky.  I do like how you''ve captured the spray coming off of the waves.', '2009-02-08 00:31:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5244646, 761314, 68504, '<td valign="top">Has some kick.</td>', 'Has some kick.', '2009-02-08 00:31:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5244648, 760847, 33068, '<td valign="top">Should have ribboned.</td>', 'Should have ribboned.', '2009-02-08 00:32:27.000000', NULL, 0),
