(5244653, 754832, 51747, '<td valign="top">This has a real nice flow to it. I voted it in my top ten. Sorry more folks didn''t see it like I did.</td>', 'This has a real nice flow to it. I voted it in my top ten. Sorry more folks didn''t see it like I did.', '2009-02-08 00:33:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5244654, 761557, 79955, '<td valign="top">aww !!!! definitely underrated. Scored this an 8. I have done shots like this and is not as easy as most people think. Nice one.</td>', 'aww !!!! definitely underrated. Scored this an 8. I have done shots like this and is not as easy as most people think. Nice one.', '2009-02-08 00:33:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5244655, 754159, 15305, '<td valign="top">The take itself has potential, but the horizon dead in the center along with the lighthouse, makes the composition somewhat rigid.<br/>It would improve a lot if you cropped it acoording to the Rule of Thirds.</td>', 'The take itself has potential, but the horizon dead in the center along with the lighthouse, makes the composition somewhat rigid.It would improve a lot if you cropped it acoording to the Rule of Thirds.', '2009-02-08 00:34:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5244657, 760475, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the light in this.  But in addition to that, you also have most artfully arranged your subject and I don''t think a lot of people realize just how hard that is to do!  Wonderful work - congrats on the ribbon and high score!</td>', 'I love the light in this.  But in addition to that, you also have most artfully arranged your subject and I don''t think a lot of people realize just how hard that is to do!  Wonderful work - congrats on the ribbon and high score!', '2009-02-08 00:34:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5244662, 753949, 79955, '<td valign="top">This one is fabulous, how the heck did it score so low. got a 9 from me !!! usually  I am not so far off with my scoring. FWIW wonderful shot.</td>', 'This one is fabulous, how the heck did it score so low. got a 9 from me !!! usually  I am not so far off with my scoring. FWIW wonderful shot.', '2009-02-08 00:35:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5244663, 760583, 50641, '<td valign="top">Like a character from the cartoon King of the Hill, come to life.  He is alive, isn''t he?  Great specs.</td>', 'Like a character from the cartoon King of the Hill, come to life.  He is alive, isn''t he?  Great specs.', '2009-02-08 00:36:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5244664, 760475, 15305, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite one for the challenge, I''m glad it ribboned! Congratulations on your first ribbon and thanks for such a wonderful shot! This is a real work of art.<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-08 00:38:05.</i></td>', 'This was my favorite one for the challenge, I''m glad it ribboned! Congratulations on your first ribbon and thanks for such a wonderful shot! This is a real work of art.', '2009-02-08 00:36:36.000000', '2009-02-08 00:38:05.000000', 0),
(5244665, 760847, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful!  I love the mood in it as well.  I''ve been to this spot, but you''ve made it look far more gorgeous, warm, and inviting than I could.  I think the serendipity of the couple in line with the alley really makes the composition work here - establishes the theme of pairs and people, then adds the magic of that location.  Excellent!</td>', 'This is wonderful!  I love the mood in it as well.  I''ve been to this spot, but you''ve made it look far more gorgeous, warm, and inviting than I could.  I think the serendipity of the couple in line with the alley really makes the composition work here - establishes the theme of pairs and people, then adds the magic of that location.  Excellent!', '2009-02-08 00:37:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5244667, 755487, 67145, '<td valign="top">very beautiful enzo .. the colours are so vibrant and alive ... the lighting excellent .. <br/>its a stunning spot and an incredible image .. :)</td>', 'very beautiful enzo .. the colours are so vibrant and alive ... the lighting excellent .. its a stunning spot and an incredible image .. :)', '2009-02-08 00:38:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5244669, 761586, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea for a portrait!</td>', 'Excellent idea for a portrait!', '2009-02-08 00:38:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5244670, 754159, 81362, '<td valign="top">In response to your post:<br/>Choice of f/3.5 caused a narrow depth of field. Some of the waves are sharp, but the lighthouse is a bit fuzzy as a result. With that fast shutter speed, you had lots of room to use a narrower apeture. Choice of 35 mm lens ends up not wide enough for a sweeping oceanscape feeling but not zoomed in enough for the lighthouse to be the main subject. You position captures layer after layer of horizontal lines all the way across the image. That makes for a static feeling despite the waves and doesn''t provide a path of interest for the eye to follow. Having the lighthouse almost all the way to the center makes this less dynamic too. Taking a different position to have the waves somewhat diagonal and the lighthouse more to the left would produce an entirely new feeling.<br/> <br/>The colors are nice, and the subtle clouds do provide some interest. Might have  processed to allow the top of the sky to be lighter, as a gradient from light blue to dark blue would provide another dimension of interest.</td>', 'In response to your post:Choice of f/3.5 caused a narrow depth of field. Some of the waves are sharp, but the lighthouse is a bit fuzzy as a result. With that fast shutter speed, you had lots of room to use a narrower apeture. Choice of 35 mm lens ends up not wide enough for a sweeping oceanscape feeling but not zoomed in enough for the lighthouse to be the main subject. You position captures layer after layer of horizontal lines all the way across the image. That makes for a static feeling despite the waves and doesn''t provide a path of interest for the eye to follow. Having the lighthouse almost all the way to the center makes this less dynamic too. Taking a different position to have the waves somewhat diagonal and the lighthouse more to the left would produce an entirely new feeling. The colors are nice, and the subtle clouds do provide some interest. Might have  processed to allow the top of the sky to be lighter, as a gradient from light blue to dark blue would provide another dimension of interest.', '2009-02-08 00:38:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5244671, 761566, 68504, '<td valign="top">I find this impressive.  You let the story dictate the exposure and processing. Nice to view.</td>', 'I find this impressive.  You let the story dictate the exposure and processing. Nice to view.', '2009-02-08 00:38:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5244673, 761153, 79955, '<td valign="top">Another one that I can''t understand, Got a 9 from me. It is beautiful and brilliantly processed. Deserved so much better. Keep up the great work.</td>', 'Another one that I can''t understand, Got a 9 from me. It is beautiful and brilliantly processed. Deserved so much better. Keep up the great work.', '2009-02-08 00:39:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5244674, 755523, 61961, '<td valign="top">I immediately thought of the Wyeth painting when I saw this.  Congrats on a well-deserved ribbon.  Fantastic.</td>', 'I immediately thought of the Wyeth painting when I saw this.  Congrats on a well-deserved ribbon.  Fantastic.', '2009-02-08 00:40:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5244675, 761598, 50695, '<td valign="top">uh-oh, I raced by this too fast while I was voting. I did score you two higher than my average for the challenge, though! :D</td>', 'uh-oh, I raced by this too fast while I was voting. I did score you two higher than my average for the challenge, though! :D', '2009-02-08 00:40:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5244676, 761025, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well you got your 6+!!  Very nice work to make what you shot turn into what you wanted, even if it wasn''t quite what you had in mind to start with.  A good way to show the journey that the process can be.  And a lovely photograph.</td>', 'Well you got your 6+!!  Very nice work to make what you shot turn into what you wanted, even if it wasn''t quite what you had in mind to start with.  A good way to show the journey that the process can be.  And a lovely photograph.', '2009-02-08 00:40:20.000000', NULL, 0),
