(5244747, 761341, 97893, '<td valign="top">There may be many good pictures in the challenge, but there<br/>are few which you create a warm resonance within you. As I was browsing the free-study for such pictures, I came  across this. You might have only 5 minutes to come up or create this picture. But what you have done is wonderful (at least, a 10 from me!)<br/> <br/>Congratulations on the wonderful capture! :-).<br/> <br/>Vikram<br/> <br/></td>', 'There may be many good pictures in the challenge, but thereare few which you create a warm resonance within you. As I was browsing the free-study for such pictures, I came  across this. You might have only 5 minutes to come up or create this picture. But what you have done is wonderful (at least, a 10 from me!) Congratulations on the wonderful capture! :-). Vikram ', '2009-02-08 01:17:11.000000', NULL, 0),
