(5244751, 761110, 97893, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully done picture. You got very good scores too, if you see from the overall voting patterns. My view is this that you can ignore the 5 and and below for this picture and continue to take this technique to your next level. The graininess and the slight framing improvement, are the only thing that might be considered for improvement.<br/> <br/>The mood, the elements (beach, birds, sea, girl, waves, sand) and the stillness of the motion that you create in this picture is simply wonderful!<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/>Vikram<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wonderfully done picture. You got very good scores too, if you see from the overall voting patterns. My view is this that you can ignore the 5 and and below for this picture and continue to take this technique to your next level. The graininess and the slight framing improvement, are the only thing that might be considered for improvement. The mood, the elements (beach, birds, sea, girl, waves, sand) and the stillness of the motion that you create in this picture is simply wonderful! Regards,Vikram ', '2009-02-08 01:24:30.000000', NULL, 0),
