(5244772, 760909, 97893, '<td valign="top">You have done so well this picture! <br/> <br/>I love it. I thought I gave it a 10, but it doesn''t show my vote. :-(.<br/> <br/>See, all the people you commented, and took time to appreciate it, gave it a very high score. 7.57.<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/>Vikram<br/> <br/>P.S. One more thing, you aperture shows 1.8, and that is what it looks like. But your lens does not have that aperture, maybe you specified other lens by mistake.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-08 01:37:43.</i></td>', 'You have done so well this picture!  I love it. I thought I gave it a 10, but it doesn''t show my vote. :-(. See, all the people you commented, and took time to appreciate it, gave it a very high score. 7.57. Regards,Vikram P.S. One more thing, you aperture shows 1.8, and that is what it looks like. But your lens does not have that aperture, maybe you specified other lens by mistake.', '2009-02-08 01:35:38.000000', '2009-02-08 01:37:43.000000', 0),
