(5244776, 755487, 54645, '<td valign="top">Well I gave it a 7! I''m surprised it did not score higher. I have nothing constructive to add. I like the triangles in the composition, as well as, the glowing lights, both with in the boats and the sky. Well done.</td>', 'Well I gave it a 7! I''m surprised it did not score higher. I have nothing constructive to add. I like the triangles in the composition, as well as, the glowing lights, both with in the boats and the sky. Well done.', '2009-02-08 01:38:43.000000', NULL, 0),
