(5244793, 761343, 97893, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best done portraits in the challenge! It has got nice tones, wonderful framing, and great intimacy to it!<br/> <br/>I don''t know why it scores lower. A 10 from me (albeit post challenge)!<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/>Vikram</td>', 'This is one of the best done portraits in the challenge! It has got nice tones, wonderful framing, and great intimacy to it! I don''t know why it scores lower. A 10 from me (albeit post challenge)! Regards,Vikram', '2009-02-08 01:58:32.000000', NULL, 0),
