(5244934, 760867, 67152, '<td valign="top">It is indeed very unfortunate that you had to hack into <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=52549" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">IreneM</a>''s computer to get the image for this challenge.<br/> <br/>Really nice work Steve -perfect focus and lighting<br/></td>', 'It is indeed very unfortunate that you had to hack into  IreneM''s computer to get the image for this challenge. Really nice work Steve -perfect focus and lighting', '2009-02-08 06:32:27.000000', NULL, 0),
