(5244942, 761044, 41746, '<td valign="top">I don´t remember having so many wonderful comments on such a low scoring image. I know this is not a typical DPC photo, strange in many ways, but I had to find out how it would be received. And despite the low scoring of 5.25 I am very satisfied with the result. Especially the comments from viewers who really looked into the image and found the story. Thanks to you all and I am honored of the Order of the Thumb from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30364" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ubique</a>.</td>', 'I don´t remember having so many wonderful comments on such a low scoring image. I know this is not a typical DPC photo, strange in many ways, but I had to find out how it would be received. And despite the low scoring of 5.25 I am very satisfied with the result. Especially the comments from viewers who really looked into the image and found the story. Thanks to you all and I am honored of the Order of the Thumb from  ubique.', '2009-02-08 06:55:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5244943, 761457, 62357, '<td valign="top">Deb, I was just looking at the distribution of scores here. Nothing less than a 4 - that''s great.  I thought it would score higher though.  Well done!</td>', 'Deb, I was just looking at the distribution of scores here. Nothing less than a 4 - that''s great.  I thought it would score higher though.  Well done!', '2009-02-08 07:00:57.000000', NULL, 0),
