(5244968, 760628, 75192, '<td valign="top">I was one of your 8''s. I really connected with this picture - I recognise that look of pain. I lost my Mum just over a year ago, she was only 57. I''m sorry to hear of your baby.</td>', 'I was one of your 8''s. I really connected with this picture - I recognise that look of pain. I lost my Mum just over a year ago, she was only 57. I''m sorry to hear of your baby.', '2009-02-08 07:45:51.000000', NULL, 0),
