(5244975, 759185, 41370, '<td valign="top">While this photo in and of its self would not be considered child pornography it is disturbing to me that a parent would let a complete stranger take their child''s photo nude and then post it on a web site.  If those parents knew what perverts do while looking at photos such as this I believe they would not have given you permission.  I worked in law enforcement for 25 years and spent 18 years as a child abuse investigator and have seen what perverts do.  Parents please think beyond the here and now...try to think about all the possiblities (positive and negative).  <br/> <br/>I am not a "nude prude".  I believe nude can be art.  I have a nude in my portfolio...but it is not a child...it is an adult.  There are boundaries.</td>', 'While this photo in and of its self would not be considered child pornography it is disturbing to me that a parent would let a complete stranger take their child''s photo nude and then post it on a web site.  If those parents knew what perverts do while looking at photos such as this I believe they would not have given you permission.  I worked in law enforcement for 25 years and spent 18 years as a child abuse investigator and have seen what perverts do.  Parents please think beyond the here and now...try to think about all the possiblities (positive and negative).   I am not a "nude prude".  I believe nude can be art.  I have a nude in my portfolio...but it is not a child...it is an adult.  There are boundaries.', '2009-02-08 07:52:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5244982, 761044, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''re an excellent photographer and it''s always a delight to see how you present the world that you photograph.  This, of course, is worth far more than the score.  It is also interesting to read the almost polarly opposed comments.  I don''t think this indicates some are "wrong" but that many here are on different parts of the journey, if that makes sense.  Really a wonderful photograph - a great example of how attention to the technicals (correct exposure, for instance) can allow breaking the rules (composition, for instance) to very good effect.</td>', 'You''re an excellent photographer and it''s always a delight to see how you present the world that you photograph.  This, of course, is worth far more than the score.  It is also interesting to read the almost polarly opposed comments.  I don''t think this indicates some are "wrong" but that many here are on different parts of the journey, if that makes sense.  Really a wonderful photograph - a great example of how attention to the technicals (correct exposure, for instance) can allow breaking the rules (composition, for instance) to very good effect.', '2009-02-08 08:09:48.000000', NULL, 0),
