(5245035, 761440, 30364, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by digifotojo:</b></div><hr/><i> Very melodramatic. Kind of reminds me of a scene out of a movie. Excellent portrayal. 9 </i></td></tr></table> <br/>That''s odd, because I gave it a 9 too, and the little red band says that mine was the only 9 vote.  <br/>Maybe there were a clutch of other 9s and 10s that somehow vanished?  It would at least explain why this finished in a ridiculous 277th place!</td>', 'Originally posted by digifotojo: Very melodramatic. Kind of reminds me of a scene out of a movie. Excellent portrayal. 9  That''s odd, because I gave it a 9 too, and the little red band says that mine was the only 9 vote.  Maybe there were a clutch of other 9s and 10s that somehow vanished?  It would at least explain why this finished in a ridiculous 277th place!', '2009-02-08 09:25:08.000000', NULL, 0),
