(5245174, 761619, 67697, '<td valign="top">Colleen this is so fascinating!  I love that bright path leading into the forest.  And the shadows coming from the sticks or icicles is a special gift of the scene.  Beautiful!</td>', 'Colleen this is so fascinating!  I love that bright path leading into the forest.  And the shadows coming from the sticks or icicles is a special gift of the scene.  Beautiful!', '2009-02-08 11:15:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245176, 755523, 24389, '<td valign="top">This is such a neat idea!</td>', 'This is such a neat idea!', '2009-02-08 11:17:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245178, 761457, 67697, '<td valign="top">I definitely like the black and white version.  It''s almost like there''s a 3-d effect going on here.  So I think you did a GREAT job with the tone-mapping.  My eye keeps going to the clock too.  Not sure what it is that keeps pulling me there.  Fascinating photo.</td>', 'I definitely like the black and white version.  It''s almost like there''s a 3-d effect going on here.  So I think you did a GREAT job with the tone-mapping.  My eye keeps going to the clock too.  Not sure what it is that keeps pulling me there.  Fascinating photo.', '2009-02-08 11:19:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245181, 760007, 67697, '<td valign="top">I don''t think it looks flat at all.  Gorgeous capture of the clouds floating around the mountains and of the steam wisps (or mini waves) coming off of the lake.  Looks like the light is hitting in all the places just right.  Must be a beautiful place to see in person!</td>', 'I don''t think it looks flat at all.  Gorgeous capture of the clouds floating around the mountains and of the steam wisps (or mini waves) coming off of the lake.  Looks like the light is hitting in all the places just right.  Must be a beautiful place to see in person!', '2009-02-08 11:22:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245182, 757947, 67697, '<td valign="top">Jeffrey, she is so pretty!  Great lighting on her face.  Love the attitude she is throwing at you lol.</td>', 'Jeffrey, she is so pretty!  Great lighting on her face.  Love the attitude she is throwing at you lol.', '2009-02-08 11:24:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245206, 759904, 73564, '<td valign="top">nice black and white, I wish there were more to the comp, its kinda cut off and not really showing anything but some pillars, lighting is good, but highlights are a tad bright.</td>', 'nice black and white, I wish there were more to the comp, its kinda cut off and not really showing anything but some pillars, lighting is good, but highlights are a tad bright.', '2009-02-08 11:35:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245215, 761456, 55892, '<td valign="top">I agree that it looks stretched. The original version was horizontal, when I rotated it the image was "squashed". I tried using the "free transform" tool.   I''ve never had this happen before in an original image.  I''ve used it successfully in many other shots;  any suggestions how I could have edited it better?</td>', 'I agree that it looks stretched. The original version was horizontal, when I rotated it the image was "squashed". I tried using the "free transform" tool.   I''ve never had this happen before in an original image.  I''ve used it successfully in many other shots;  any suggestions how I could have edited it better?', '2009-02-08 11:44:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245282, 760862, 39057, '<td valign="top">Was the snowshoe trail another photographer that was there before you?<br/> <br/><i>And, the frozen lake is not very pretty, since the snow has been sandblasted away and there are signs of the snowshoe trail. </i></td>', 'Was the snowshoe trail another photographer that was there before you? And, the frozen lake is not very pretty, since the snow has been sandblasted away and there are signs of the snowshoe trail. ', '2009-02-08 12:48:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245307, 754832, 52549, '<td valign="top">Agree with Sue, it would make an outstanding print. Great work, and very underrated.</td>', 'Agree with Sue, it would make an outstanding print. Great work, and very underrated.', '2009-02-08 13:29:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245311, 755523, 16241, '<td valign="top">love this, congrats.</td>', 'love this, congrats.', '2009-02-08 13:35:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245352, 760475, 62249, '<td valign="top">Really excellent lighting and composition. Manages to be both painterly and photographic at the same time. Adding to my favorites.</td>', 'Really excellent lighting and composition. Manages to be both painterly and photographic at the same time. Adding to my favorites.', '2009-02-08 14:09:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245358, 755523, 37961, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite all time photo. You did a wonderful job of recreating it. WOW.</td>', 'This is my favorite all time photo. You did a wonderful job of recreating it. WOW.', '2009-02-08 14:18:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245368, 761598, 55642, '<td valign="top">Soooo underrated! I gave it a 7 in voting. I didn''t recognize it as a Lensbaby shot, but I love the soft, dreamy focus. It''s wonderfully artistic.</td>', 'Soooo underrated! I gave it a 7 in voting. I didn''t recognize it as a Lensbaby shot, but I love the soft, dreamy focus. It''s wonderfully artistic.', '2009-02-08 14:32:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245377, 759948, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail in the feathers. I wish there was more light on the birds face. I might have tried a filter&gt;render&gt;lighting effects using the omni light on the face. It''s tricky to get it just right, but it can do a very nice job of adding light to important areas that are in shadow. I have used it on faces that are shaded by baseball caps. You might be able to achieve the feel of a second source of light being reflected from water below the bird.</td>', 'Beautiful detail in the feathers. I wish there was more light on the birds face. I might have tried a filter>render>lighting effects using the omni light on the face. It''s tricky to get it just right, but it can do a very nice job of adding light to important areas that are in shadow. I have used it on faces that are shaded by baseball caps. You might be able to achieve the feel of a second source of light being reflected from water below the bird.', '2009-02-08 14:43:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245379, 761657, 28172, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the great comments!  I love to photograph birds and especially pelicans!  They are one of my favorite birds as they are both beautiful and somewhat cumbersome in their appearance. This was a last hour entry, as my computer crashed and I almost missed the deadline.  As with most of my wildlife shots, this was a lucky capture.  We arrived at feeding time for them and this one bird, in particular was a great fisherman!</td>', 'Thanks for all the great comments!  I love to photograph birds and especially pelicans!  They are one of my favorite birds as they are both beautiful and somewhat cumbersome in their appearance. This was a last hour entry, as my computer crashed and I almost missed the deadline.  As with most of my wildlife shots, this was a lucky capture.  We arrived at feeding time for them and this one bird, in particular was a great fisherman!', '2009-02-08 14:46:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245384, 757947, 66384, '<td valign="top">What a difference two years makes. I have really enjoyed this series of photos. I just wish she didn''t have on so much lip ''GLOSS!'' ;) I think it is distracting. However, it also says, by it''s inexpert application, that she is trying to be older than she really is. Perhaps that says more about her than any of the expressions you captured.</td>', 'What a difference two years makes. I have really enjoyed this series of photos. I just wish she didn''t have on so much lip ''GLOSS!'' ;) I think it is distracting. However, it also says, by it''s inexpert application, that she is trying to be older than she really is. Perhaps that says more about her than any of the expressions you captured.', '2009-02-08 14:52:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245397, 757049, 66384, '<td valign="top">Yeah, lensbaby put to good use. The chairs have almost a human quality -- they are so ''together''. They are empty, but somehow alive in their emptiness. Beautiful and poignant shot.</td>', 'Yeah, lensbaby put to good use. The chairs have almost a human quality -- they are so ''together''. They are empty, but somehow alive in their emptiness. Beautiful and poignant shot.', '2009-02-08 15:00:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245405, 760844, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely, and natural looking for HDR. I still haven''t got the hang of tone mapping. This is a great example of what HDR should look like -- still plenty of depth to the shot.</td>', 'Lovely, and natural looking for HDR. I still haven''t got the hang of tone mapping. This is a great example of what HDR should look like -- still plenty of depth to the shot.', '2009-02-08 15:04:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245414, 761417, 57421, '<td valign="top">love it. totally underrated. gutsy as this was to be expected - not the clean sharp DPC style.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-08 15:30:37.</i></td>', 'love it. totally underrated. gutsy as this was to be expected - not the clean sharp DPC style.', '2009-02-08 15:30:24.000000', '2009-02-08 15:30:37.000000', 0),
(5245422, 757049, 30982, '<td valign="top">You know I like this shot and what it symbolizes.  And I think based on your commenter average (and the comments themselves) that a great deal of the viewers DID appreciate this, and the method behind the creation.  I wouldn''t say it met with broad disapproval.  On the contrary, I think it is shots just like this one, and maybe especially this one, that cause some to linger a bit longer, to take in the effect and why it works.  There will always be those who prefer tack sharp - and there''s nothing wrong with that.  But you''ve maybe grabbed one or two who otherwise would have sped by and who will now take a bit longer look at the next Lensbaby or motion blur photograph they come upon.  And that, my friend, is a good thing.</td>', 'You know I like this shot and what it symbolizes.  And I think based on your commenter average (and the comments themselves) that a great deal of the viewers DID appreciate this, and the method behind the creation.  I wouldn''t say it met with broad disapproval.  On the contrary, I think it is shots just like this one, and maybe especially this one, that cause some to linger a bit longer, to take in the effect and why it works.  There will always be those who prefer tack sharp - and there''s nothing wrong with that.  But you''ve maybe grabbed one or two who otherwise would have sped by and who will now take a bit longer look at the next Lensbaby or motion blur photograph they come upon.  And that, my friend, is a good thing.', '2009-02-08 15:45:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5245429, 761417, 3214, '<td valign="top">Gutsy indeed, for this audience.  I don''t like many LB shots but I do like this one very much.</td>', 'Gutsy indeed, for this audience.  I don''t like many LB shots but I do like this one very much.', '2009-02-08 15:54:14.000000', NULL, 0),
