(5245451, 756955, 69668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by chromeydome:</b></div><hr/><i> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>simple, perfect, masterfully done </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks....I always appreciate it!!!!  Your the best.</td>', 'Originally posted by chromeydome: PostLuminous Award Nominee!simple, perfect, masterfully done   Thanks....I always appreciate it!!!!  Your the best.', '2009-02-08 16:19:54.000000', NULL, 0),
