(5435487, 753949, 39427, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot and would have given it a 9, really cute, spunky girl, and I love the green motif.  Can''t really think we it didn''t score a lot higher except that the top part of the image doesn''t add much to the composition, I would probably prefer the shot more focused on the girl with less space around.  Doesn''t look over-exposed to me but i know nothing of glamour shots</td>', 'I like this shot a lot and would have given it a 9, really cute, spunky girl, and I love the green motif.  Can''t really think we it didn''t score a lot higher except that the top part of the image doesn''t add much to the composition, I would probably prefer the shot more focused on the girl with less space around.  Doesn''t look over-exposed to me but i know nothing of glamour shots', '2009-04-13 20:22:32.000000', NULL, 0),
